    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（と、勢いよく出てきたまでは良かったけど、\r\nなかなかピンとくる子がいないな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（雨も降ってきたし……\r\nどこか、雨宿りできるところは……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0125"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeOutQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "bgm": "off",
    "se": "0126",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "bg": "00025",
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0140",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、ここなら濡れないか……\r\nずいぶん大降りになってきたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "016"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0141",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "ひゃーっ、雨とか聞いてないってー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 700
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "グッズ濡れてないよね？　大丈夫だよね？　えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あの子も雨宿りか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……ん？　おおっ、すごいなあのカバン\r\n人気アイドルのライブ限定品がぎっしり……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010030,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "こっちは平気だし、これも……！\r\n……ん、全部おっけー！　良かったぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010040,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "あ、すみません騒がしくしちゃって！\r\nうるさかったですよね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　ああ、いえ。大丈夫ですよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010050,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "それなら良かったです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010060,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……これ私の方が濡れちゃってるな……ハンカチは──",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0135",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あ。缶バッジ、落としましたよ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "えっ？　あ、ほんとだ！\r\nすみませんっ、ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010080,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "良かったぁ……！\r\nこれ限定のヤツなんです、助かりました！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──……いい笑顔だなぁ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……それに、缶バッジでこんなに喜ぶところといい、\r\nあれだけのグッズといい、本当にアイドルが好きなんだ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……この子なら、きっと……！）"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あの……すみません\r\n急にこんなこと言われて戸惑うかもしれないんですが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルに、興味はありませんか？"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……はい？　アイドル？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうです\r\nあなたに、アイドルになってもらいたいと思いました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……え、えーと……いきなり何事っていうか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……あっ。お兄さんも実はドルオタなんですか？\r\n話せそうな人見つけちゃって嬉しいなー、みたいな！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100700101/1007001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1007001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "それとも遠回しなナンパです？\r\n俺だけのアイドルになってくれ、的な",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
